- The plugin's `get_sdb` returns `ao->kv` (a reference to the plugin's internal kv)
- `obj.c` assigns `o->kv = new_kv`, taking ownership
- When the plugin's `destroy` method is called, it frees `obj->kv` with `sdb_free(obj->kv)`
- Later, when the RBinObject is destroyed, it will also try to free `o->kv`, which is the same pointer, leading to a double-free

